<title>SINGAPORE: DIARY - Singapore IPO share offerings - Sept 12.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Singapore IPO share offerings - Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of expected initial public share offerings (IPOs) in Singapore.</p>
<p>* Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) approval granted</p>
<p>===========================================================</p>
<p>  COMPANY	  SHRS     CURRENCY/   EXPECTED OPEN/  LEAD</p>
<p>		     (MLN)	PRICE	 LIST DATE</p>
<p>===========================================================</p>
<p>  Amara Holdings  --	   --		--	    --</p>
<p>(Amara Holdings Ltd is a hotel company.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  CM Telecom	--	  --		 --	    --</p>
<p>(Full name - CM Telecoms International Ltd.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  EasyKnit	  --	  HK$	    August	 OCBC</p>
<p>(Easyknit International Holdings Ltd is a Hong Kong-based textile company. The firm's primary listing is in Hong Kong.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  FJ Benjamin Hdg --	  S$	     August	  --</p>
<p>(FJ Benjamin Holdings retails, distributes and licenses fashion labels, accessories, watches and home fashions. It has said it has received in-principle approval from the SES to list shares on the main board.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  GES Singapore   --	  S$		1996	   --</p>
<p>(GES Singapore Pte Ltd makes personal computers.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  Guangzhou Inv Co 68	HK$		 --	   UOB</p>
<p>(Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd is the Hongkong-listed investment arm of the southern Chinese city of Guangzhou. Its primary listing is in Hong Kong.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  Presscrete Engineering    S$	     October	 --</p>
<p>(Structural and ground engineering company Presscrete Engineering Pte Ltd has said it hopes to list on SESDAQ)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  Raffles Hdgs    --	  S$	   H1 1997	   --</p>
<p>(Raffles Holdings is the hotel arm of DBS Land and manages Singapore's Raffles Hotel.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  Sinochem	  --	  --	    August	  UOB</p>
<p>(Sinochem Asia Holdings is an arm of the Chinese state oil and commodities company Simochem. The company has applied to the SES for a listing.)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> *SMB United    103.03    S$0.29	 Sept 23	   UOB</p>
<p>(SMB United manufactures electrical switchgears and supplies electrical components for power distribution and control. It has received in-principle approval for a listing from the SES.)</p>
<p>===========================================================</p>
